                 <property name="whatsThis">
                  <string>The Data tree shows the virtual game directory MO2 exposes to the selected game. Files stay in their source mods or archives; MO2 does not copy them into the physical game folder. The Mod column identifies the winning source. Conflicts only filters to files with alternatives, and Show archive files includes entries provided by archives. Right-click a file for the preview, open, Explorer, and Mod Info actions available for it.</string>
